+        """Wrap a binary file-like object so that reading advances a task.
+
+        The wrapped file is not closed by the returned reader.
+
+        Args:
+            file (BinaryIO): An open binary file-like object to read from.
+            total (float, optional): Total size in bytes. Default is the total of ``task_id``.
+            task_id (TaskID, optional): Existing task to update. Default creates a new task.
+            description (str, optional): Description of a new task. Defaults to "Reading...".
+
+        Raises:
